### Add products
POST http://localhost:3000/products/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "name": "Keyboard",
    "price": 500,
    "quantity": 1
  },
  {
    "name": "Mouse",
    "price": 450,
    "quantity": 3
  },
  {
    "name": "Flash Drive",
    "price": 300,
    "quantity": 5
  },
  {
    "name": "Headphones",
    "price": 490,
    "quantity": 2
  },
  {
    "name": "Power Bank",
    "price": 800,
    "quantity": 4
  }
]

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### Get products filtered by name
GET http://localhost:3000/products?name=Headphones

### Get products sorted by price descending
GET http://localhost:3000/products?sort=-price

### Get a single product by id
GET http://localhost:3000/products/3

### Update a product completely
PUT http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 900,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Partially update a product
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 990
}

### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/2
